{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はもう暑くて\n夏服で過ごせちゃいますね～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は収録ウィークだったので\nいろんな現場に行かせてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく刺激もたくさんあるし\n勉強になるし、何より\n共演したことがある方が\nだんだん増えてくると\nちょっとずつ緊張も解れます∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再来週オンエアのものが多めなので\nまた告知するね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2017/06/10/9689848/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最年少のぴちぴちれんか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TV"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎発掘！エトセトラさん   6/16\n◎Qさま！！                 近日\n◎櫻井・有吉THE夜会     6/22"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌・web"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎東京ウォーカー\n◎千葉ウォーカー\n◎アップトゥーボーイ\n◎ミューズクリップ\n◎MARQUEE\n◎週刊朝日\n◎FRIDAY\n◎モデルプレス\n◎BRODY   6/23\n◎BUBKA   6/30"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2017/06/10/9689848/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qさま！！楽屋貼りでの\n写真もたくさん溜まってきました～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qさまファミリーのみなさんは\nいつも暖かく応援してくださります(ノω・、)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌 Hanakoでスイーツとかフルーツの\n特集をしていると必ず買っちゃう♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこも行きたいところだら